# Environment variables for ui-registry (docker-container)
# Generated by genproj. Copy to `.env` next to docker-compose.yml and fill in
# real values (genproj never commits secrets).
#
# Keys are derived from the docker-container `envVars` configuration; nothing
# is invented here.

# There are no secrets. NB_REGISTRY_TOKEN was removed on 2026-11-14, from this
# file, from Doppler `common` (dev/prd), and from the deployed host. The registry
# endpoint is public: `shadcn-svelte@1.8.1` sends no auth headers, so a gated
# registry is unconsumable by the only client that reads it. Do not add one back
# unless a client that can send a header arrives first. See README "Registry".

# Not needed to run this container, and deliberately not here: the URL a
# *consumer* pins lives in Doppler (`common`: COMPONENTS_REGISTRY_URL) so no
# generated project carries a hostname. See README "Where the registry URL lives".
